OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 24 Aug to Wed 2 Sep
OL,6,FLargely dry and settled early next
OL,7,Fweek as a ridge of high pressure
OL,8,Fcontinues to extend across the
OL,9,Fcountry. Likely turning more unsettled
OL,10,Fduring the week and through to the
OL,11,Fturn of the month as low pressure
OL,12,Fbecomes more dominant. This bringing
OL,13,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,14,Fperhaps heavy, to most if not all
OL,15,Fareas at times though still some sunny
OL,16,Finterludes. Possibly windy at times
OL,17,Ftoo. Temperatures likely near to
OL,18,Faverage though varying with some short-
OL,19,Flived warm and humid spells possible,
OL,20,Fespecially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
