OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1787154516
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 3 Sep to Thu 17 SepFA
OL,6,Frather unsettled start to autumn is
OL,7,Fmost likely with all areas probably
OL,8,Fseeing a mixture of showers or longer
OL,9,Fspells rain interspersed with drier
OL,10,Finterludes. Temperatures likely
OL,11,Fvarying around average, some warm or
OL,12,Fhot spells are possible but unlikely
OL,13,Fprolonged in early September. By mid-
OL,14,FSeptember, there may be an increase in
OL,15,Fthe extent of drier, more settled
OL,16,Fweather, especially in the south and
OL,17,Feast, though signals become very weak.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
